This repository contains build scripts, patches and documentation only. It does
not redistribute dReal or IBEX source code; those are downloaded from their
upstream repositories at pinned revisions and verified by SHA256, and the
patches in patches/ are applied to the downloaded trees.

IBEX, built here from dreal-deps/ibex-lib at the revision pinned in
versions.lock, is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 3, and is linked dynamically.

The Python binding is compiled against pybind11 (https://github.com/pybind/pybind11),
licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. pybind11 is header-only, so it is
compiled into the extension module and is not a separate redistributed file; the
revision is pinned in versions.lock and fetched by the build. The installed
`dreal` Python package also includes dReal's own `dreal/__init__.py`, which is
part of dReal and Apache-2.0.

Python itself is not redistributed: the build uses the interpreter the host
already has (see Brewfile), and the extension module links no libpython.

See docs/upstream-licenses.md for the licences of everything else this build
requires or links, and for what they oblige anyone redistributing a binary.
